.SH NOTES
This tool is part of the SystemVerilog Decompiler research project exploring formal verification of hardware synthesis tools.

The structural backend's register inference reporting mimics Synopsys Design Compiler for familiarity to hardware engineers.

Verification uses Z3 SMT solver for formal equivalence checking, providing mathematical guarantees when successful.
